    LLM: 'Expose high cards and Aces early; build foundations as soon as possible; avoid blocking tableau piles with low cards.\n\nPrefer moving from waste to foundation when legal; move tableau cards to free spaces and unblock lower cards; plan the single pass through the stock.\n\nOrder of turning stock cards is critical; look ahead to which tableau columns will accept which ranks; minimize deadlock in the single pass.',
